# Valet v2 server environment (`make dev-local` loads this file).
# Copy to `.env` and fill in real values. Never commit `.env`.
# Full reference: docs/environment-variables.md

# ── Core (required) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Anthropic key for the agent loop. The server exits without it.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# ── LLM providers (optional env fallbacks) ───────────────────────────
# Org-level provider keys can also be added in the UI (Settings → Models).
#OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
#OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
#GEMINI_API_KEY=...

# ── Storage (optional) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Unset → embedded PGlite under the data dir (default ~/.valet).
#DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:pass@localhost:5432/valet
#VALET_DATA_DIR=~/.valet

# AES-256-GCM key for credentials at rest. Warned if unset; set it before
# storing real integration credentials.
#VALET_ENCRYPTION_KEY=32-byte-random-string

# ── Auth ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Unset → the local dev stub applies (with VALET_LOCAL_AUTH=1).
# Set → real better-auth (email/password + any providers configured below).
#BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=long-random-string
#BETTER_AUTH_URL=http://localhost:8788

# Stub identity for local dev. MUTUALLY EXCLUSIVE with BETTER_AUTH_SECRET:
# the stub identity is an admin, so the two together would give admin access
# to every credential-less request. The server refuses to boot when both are
# set. Comment this line out before you enable real auth.
VALET_LOCAL_AUTH=1

# Generic OIDC SSO (e.g. Keycloak). All three required together.
# The values below match the local harness: `make dev-keycloak` boots
# Keycloak on :8081 with the imported `valet` realm.
#AUTH_OIDC_ISSUER=http://localhost:8081/realms/valet
#AUTH_OIDC_CLIENT_ID=valet
#AUTH_OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET=valet-dev-secret
#AUTH_OIDC_NAME=Keycloak
#AUTH_OIDC_DOMAIN=example.com

# Social login (all-or-none pairs).
#AUTH_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=...
#AUTH_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=...
#AUTH_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=...
#AUTH_GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=...

# Restrict signup to these email domains (comma-separated).
#AUTH_ALLOWED_EMAIL_DOMAINS=example.com

# ── Sandboxes (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# docker (default) | local | kubernetes
#VALET_SANDBOX_BACKEND=docker
# Sandbox image. Required for kubernetes; docker defaults to node:20-bookworm.
# Point at valet-sandbox:dev (make k8s-build) to get terminal/VS Code tabs.
#VALET_SANDBOX_IMAGE=valet-sandbox:dev

# ── Channels (optional) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Public URL for channel webhooks. Unset → long-poll mode (zero config).
#VALET_PUBLIC_URL=https://valet.example.com

# ── Observability (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# OTLP endpoint for traces + metrics. Unset → no OTel SDK starts.
#OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:4318
